 carry batons, stun devices, daggers, or pepper spray for self-defense; keeping them in your car also counts as carrying"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["If found carrying items such as daggers, switchblades, police batons,…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/en/book/09"},"children":["Read the whole topic: Legal pitfalls that ordinary people often overlook"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored","data-ad-placement":"ad_footer","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-ready":"false","aria-label":"Advertisement · Community recommendation"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-brand"},"children":[{"tag":"img","props":{"src":"/sites/howtolivebetter/images/shengcai/logo.png","width":"565","height":"144","alt":"Official Shengcai Youshu logo","decoding":"async"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-copy"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-label"},"children":["Advertisement · Community recommendation"]},{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Could what you know become a useful product?"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["From ebooks to small tools, explore how members spot needs and turn knowledge into something people can use."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-actions"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-link","href":"/en/shengcaiyoushu?sc_group=reading&sc_creative=read_product&sc_placement=ad_footer"},"children":["Explore the community